====================================================================
ACTION-TO-PERCEPT FLOW DETECTOR (value-weighted attention rollout)
Script: run_flow_entropy_detector.py   Data: flow_entropy.npz (n=250)
====================================================================

STATISTIC: for each generated action token, roll out attention through ALL 32
layers (Abnar & Zuidema residual-corrected product), with each layer's matrix
value-weighted (Kobayashi: alpha * ||v||, row-normalized). Take the resulting
flow distribution over the 256 image patches. Two scorings tested:
  - flow ENTROPY (normalized Shannon)
  - flow CONCENTRATION (max-patch share)
Baselines from the SAME forward pass: last-layer raw-weight entropy
(AttenTD/Bera-style) and T2IShield F-norm.

RESULTS (5-role protocol, disjoint seeds, 10 tasks):

statistic                     poisonAUC  ketchupAUC  milkAUC   spec.gap
FLOW concentration (vw)          1.0000      0.5456    0.5188   +0.4544  <-- WINNER
FLOW entropy (vw)                1.0000      0.9802    0.8090   +0.0198  (novelty-ish)
FLOW entropy (weight-based)      1.0000      0.9710    0.8922   +0.0290
last-layer entropy (baseline)    0.5644      0.6024    0.5046   -0.0380  (raw weights FAIL)
T2IShield F-norm (baseline)      0.9846      0.5728    0.5382   +0.4118

FLOW CONCENTRATION -- FIXED CONSTANT, SINGLE FRAME, GLOBAL OPEN MARGIN:
  poison  [0.0150, 0.0189]
  clean   [0.0071, 0.0130]   ketchup [0.0094, 0.0107]   milk [0.0085, 0.0114]
  global margin +0.0020 OPEN over all 250 scenes: any constant in
  (0.0130, 0.0150) separates every poison scene from every benign scene.
  VAL-frozen thr 0.0140 -> TEST 100% poison / 0% clean / 0% ketchup / 0% milk.
  No episode aggregation needed (first single-frame statistic in the project
  with an open margin), no layer selection (rollout uses all 32 layers BY
  CONSTRUCTION), threshold transfers across unseen tasks.

LOCALIZATION FOR FREE: flow-map argmax = patch 211 (trigger) in 50/50 poison
scenes; clean/decoy argmaxes are dispersed (ketchup only 20/50 at 211 and its
concentration stays at clean level -- attracts a glance, does not funnel flow).

WHY THE PIECES MATTER (ablations from the same run):
  - single-layer raw weights: AUROC 0.56 -- unusable (validates the
    interpretability critique of raw attention as an explanation).
  - rollout + entropy: detects (1.0) but decoys also fire (0.97/0.81) --
    entropy is a global diffuseness measure, hence novelty-sensitive.
  - rollout + value-weighting + CONCENTRATION: detection AND specificity.

DISTINCTION FROM T2IShield: activations not weights; accumulated multi-layer
flow not one layer; concentration of action->percept flow not F-norm
dispersion of text maps; action queries not text tokens.
